      "id": "meridian-incident-day",
      "title": "Meridian incident day",
      "description": "An incident diagnosis changes twice as later telemetry and partner evidence arrive.",
      "filename": "meridian-incident-day.wav",
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "segment-1",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 6200,
          "speaker_id": "nia",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "The Meridian incident began with duplicate invoices reported by three customers.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-2",
          "start_ms": 7000,
          "end_ms": 13200,
          "speaker_id": "leo",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "My first hypothesis is database replica lag causing invoice writes to repeat.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-3",
          "start_ms": 14000,
          "end_ms": 20200,
          "speaker_id": "nia",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "Nia owns the rollback investigation and will report back before noon.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-4",
          "start_ms": 21000,
          "end_ms": 27200,
          "speaker_id": "omar",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "Until we know more, disable the automated invoice export to contain customer impact.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-5",
          "start_ms": 28000,
          "end_ms": 34200,
          "speaker_id": "leo",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "Database write identifiers are unique and replica lag stayed normal, so the first hypothesis is unsupported.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-6",
          "start_ms": 35000,
          "end_ms": 41200,
          "speaker_id": "nia",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "The worker logs show repeated delivery attempts with the same internal job identifier.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-7",
          "start_ms": 42000,
          "end_ms": 48200,
          "speaker_id": "leo",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "The working diagnosis is now an internal retry-queue defect rather than the database.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-8",
          "start_ms": 49000,
          "end_ms": 55200,
          "speaker_id": "omar",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "I am checking the partner webhook responses because every repeated job followed an external timeout.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-9",
          "start_ms": 56000,
          "end_ms": 62200,
          "speaker_id": "omar",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "The partner returned accepted, then a delayed server error, which made our client replay a completed event.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-10",
          "start_ms": 63000,
          "end_ms": 69200,
          "speaker_id": "nia",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "That evidence supersedes the retry-queue diagnosis; the root cause is ambiguous partner acknowledgement handling.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-11",
          "start_ms": 70000,
          "end_ms": 76200,
          "speaker_id": "leo",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "Mitigate by deduplicating on the partner event identifier before any invoice write.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-12",
          "start_ms": 77000,
          "end_ms": 83200,
          "speaker_id": "nia",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "Omar will own the mitigation because he has the partner integration context.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-13",
          "start_ms": 84000,
          "end_ms": 90200,
          "speaker_id": "omar",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "The event-identifier deduplication patch is deployed to the canary worker.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-14",
          "start_ms": 91000,
          "end_ms": 97200,
          "speaker_id": "leo",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "No duplicate invoices appeared during the forty-minute canary observation window.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-15",
          "start_ms": 98000,
          "end_ms": 104200,
          "speaker_id": "nia",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "The incident is resolved; automated invoice export can resume gradually.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-16",
          "start_ms": 105000,
          "end_ms": 111200,
          "speaker_id": "omar",
          "language_bcp47": "en-US",
          "text": "Follow-up for Tuesday: document partner acknowledgement semantics and add a replay regression test.",
          "confidence": 1.0
        }
